~ intro
# Light filters in through a window over a desk (I’ll draw it soon)
do Music.switch("Sunshine")
Clay: You’d think at some point I’d stop falling asleep here.
Clay: Ain’t nothing to do about it...
# Mail comes in through the slot
Clay: What's new from the city, then?
Clay: No photo...
do Music.switch("Silence")
Clay: uuuuuggggggghhhhhhhhh........
do Music.switch("Sunshine")
Clay: It's... fine...
Clay: All that's here is that there was a theft at the bank in town...
# Maybe have something here that explains why we wouldn’t include questions that are directly related to the crime
Clay: Never can be an easy job, eh? Well. Time to get to it!
=> END

~ clover
- How are you?
     Clover: 
- Where were you two nights ago? [if DialogueVars.talked_to_howard]
    Clover: Clay.
    Clay: Yes...?
    Clover: Surely you know better than to expect I’ll remember that...
    Clay: That’s fair.
-  Do you remember coming across a gold ring? [if DialogueVars.talked_to_seb]
    Clover: Yes, actually. Why?
    Clay: I’m investigating a robbery and I was wondering if they would’ve sold it to you.
    Clover: Well, this was sold to me a while back...
    Clover: I don’t know that it’d be what your looking for.
    Clay: ...
    Clay: Just tell me and I’ll decide that.
    Clover:It was a very nice ring.
    Clay: Do you happen to remember who sold it to you?
    Clover: What is with you today and asking me to remember things...?
    do Music.switch("Secret Jingle")
    Clover: As far as I remember, it was strange young man with reddish hair.
    do Music.switch("Nice Day")
    Clay: Well... That’s not helpful.
set DialogueVars.talked_to_clover = true
=> END

~ howard
- How are you?
    Howard: Good, business has been decent recently.
- Where were you during the break-in?
    Howard: I was in my room.
    Howard: I ended my day a couple hours before and was relaxing.
    Clay: By relaxing, do you happen to mean sleeping?
    Howard: More or less.
- What was stolen?
    Howard: I... [wait=1] don’t know
    Clay: ...
    Howard: Please understand. There were several cases broken.
    Clay: You know how much harder this is going to make this...?
    Howard: I’m very sorry, but if there’s anything I CAN help with I will.
- Is there anything else you think I need to know?
    Howard: Not really...
    Howard: You could go talk to Seb though...
    Clay: Why would I do that?
    Howard: Well, I ju-
    Clay: Before you say anythin’ else, just know that there’s no way I will ever want to talk to that spoiled egg.
    do Music.switch("Secret Jingle")
    Howard: Th-the point is that he works here.
    do Music.switch("Nice Day")
    Clay: Seb... [wait=1] has a job?
    Howard: Yes...?
    Clay: Well damn, didn’t think Sebby would ever do somethin’ actually useful.
- How was babysitting? [if DialogueVars.talked_to_apple]
    Howard: ...
    Clay: Is there any reason you didn’t tell me this before?
    Howard: Not really...?
    Clay: Then why didn’t you tell me?
    Howard: Joyce doesn’t like it when too much attention is called to it.
    Clay: I am investigating. A CRIME.
    Clay: That doesn’t matter.
set DialogueVars.talked_to_howard = true

=> END

