~ seb
- How are you?
    Seb: Well, if you MUST ask, I was on my way home from the checking on the railroad progress.
    Clay: Well, Seb
    Seb: please stop calling me that
    Clay: I’m glad that you’re keeping yourself busy.
- Did you happen to overhear anything while you were working two nights ago? [if DialogueVars.talked_to_howard]
    Seb: ...
    Clay: What? Did you not want me to know that you were working?
    Seb: Is maintaining one’s image and status a crime?
    Clay: No, but while you definitely need to keep that a secret to avoid jokes...
    Clay: This is related to a crime, so I need information.
    Clay: Anyways, don’t lie to me again.
    Clay: Understood?
    Seb: yessir
    Clay: Anyways... Did you overhear anything?
    Seb: Well, there was a smashing sound and I took a picture.
    Clay: ...
    Seb: ...
    Clay: You took a picture.
    Seb: Yes...?
    Clay: And didn’t TELL ME?!?
    Seb: sorry
    Clay: It’s fine...
    Clay: Just show me the picture.
    Seb: Here it is.
    Clay: ...
    Seb: ...
    Clay: What is this?
    Seb: I know what it looks like...
    Clay: How did you manage to get this blurry of a photo?
    Clay: It looks like an explosion just happened.
    Seb: I tripped, okay!? I couldn’t better than that.
    Clay: ...
    do Music.switch("Secret Jingle")
    Clay: Wait.
    Clay: There’s a gold ring in their hand.
    do Music.switch("Nice Day")
    Seb: What?
    Clay: Well. It seems you were actually helpful.
    set DialogueVars.talked_to_seb = true
=> END

